Count native DMA submissions exactly once.

Count VIF/GIF submissions at sendDma/sendDmaChain, including empty submissions,
and scratchpad submissions at their MMIO handler. Previously nonempty MMIO
VIF/GIF transfers incremented both eeDmaStore and deliverDma, while empty HLE
submissions were omitted. Test direct, empty, chain, MMIO and scratchpad paths
and reinitialization. Counter accuracy fix; no measured FPS improvement claimed.

